          "at": "2026-11-11T02:15:55.649Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: <code>epic window launch</code> now refuses in a repo <code>epic init</code> never set up, says nothing was made, and points to <code>epic init</code> or <code>/isolate &lt;name&gt;</code>. Tried for real from a scratch repo: exit 1, no worktree, branch or window file.</p>\n<p>Not yet true: <code>/isolate</code> in such a repo. The worktree hook makes Claude Code's plain worktree there, but from reading the code the skill's window steps (<code>epic window open</code>, <code>handoff</code>) would fall back to the kit, as launch did. Not tried.</p>"
